  "identifier": "biomni",
  "name": "Biomni",
  "description": "General-purpose biomedical AI agent framework from Stanford SNAP Lab. Combines LLM reasoning with retrieval-augmented planning and code execution to autonomously run biomedical research workflows — CRISPR screening, drug property prediction, RNA-seq annotation, GWAS analysis, and rare disease diagnosis. Integrates external tools via MCP.",
