  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Promising biomedical AI agent framework from Stanford SNAP with strong traction (3.1k stars, Apache-2.0). Uses MCP for external tool integration, supports Claude, GPT-4, Gemini, and custom models. Covers a wide range of biomedical research workflows. Critical caveat: executes LLM-generated code with full system privileges — authors require sandboxed environments. Research prototype (v0.0.8); not suitable for clinical production or sensitive data without isolation. Track as the MCP-native biomedical agent ecosystem matures.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-12",

